  framework kernel (L6/L16 coded), a_0 canonical fixed, ZERO free parameters : rms 0.1453 dex, median offset +0.0298
  abundance-matched NFW halo (Moster+2013 x Dutton-Maccio 2014), ZERO free parameters : rms 0.1711 dex, median offset -0.0261
  cosmic-ratio halo (lower bound)                                                     : rms 0.2449 dex
  the same halo POPULATION with its own 0.25 dex M_200 and 0.11 dex c scatter switched on (40 draws) : rms 0.1980 +- 0.0077 dex
  [PASS] C1 [control] L16's fixed-a_0 kernel scatter 0.142 dex reproduces   (here 0.1421 dex (alt 0.1421, canonical 0.1453) vs L16's 0.142)
  [PASS] C2 [control] L16's abundance-matched halo scatter 0.171 dex reproduces   (here 0.1711 dex vs L16's 0.171)
  [PASS] C3 [control] L16's halo-population-scatter number 0.198 dex reproduces   (here 0.1980 dex vs L16's 0.198)
