F2 [DEGREES OF FREEDOM] -- charge for the parameters: information criteria, then held-out prediction
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  chi^2 uses sigma = quadrature(2 eV/(V ln10), 0.036 dex).  Every prior-constrained parameter is counted
  as a FULL parameter, which is the convention most favourable to the zero-parameter kernel.
