F5/F6 [WHICH KERNEL, BOTH FOOTINGS] -- HANDOFF_CONTRACT D1 is unresolved, so run all of them
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The saturated form actually coded in L6/L16 is neither document's kernel: above y = 2.540 it holds the
  boost at a CONSTANT 0.6476 a_0 instead of letting it die, which is a real difference at high acceleration.
